    {
      "entity_revision_id": "entity-revision:50310ac034070525c396754cdf46bc71fff218f20e66eddc4de8928dbf04f681",
      "entity_id": "final-case:014-1",
      "kind": "case",
      "source_quotes": [
        {
          "source_revision_id": "source-revision:e3eac845e75059ebdfb8788e0c59d62c",
          "passage_id": null,
          "start": 15863,
          "end": 16005,
          "offset_unit": "unicode_codepoint",
          "url": "https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=en&chapter=950329",
          "quote": "如午月戊辰日占妹臨產吉凶得火地晉\n\n官鬼巳火⚊\n\n兄弟酉金⚊世\n\n妻財卯木⚋\n\n官鬼巳火⚋\n\n父母未土⚋應\n\n酉金兄爻為用神,月令克之,日建生之,許之無礙,卯日卯時必生,果于次日卯時生,母子平安,應卯時者,酉金與辰日相合。黃金策曰:若逢合住,必待沖開,此月克而日生,無增克制或幫扶也。",
          "quote_hash": "e9863ce786c6ec70602ea1ed8c6d75972fdceeca3d2e195a149a812422bc84e1"
        }
      ],
